    "039c0d216172af65ba5e4e8ce69369a58b18f6dcb94fdb0c88328c1e144d3704": {
      "en": "<p>Lead developer of Cerebro, an internal tool that matches consultants' profiles to client tenders using LLMs.</p><ul><li><p>Designed an AI pipeline that extracts, categorises and scores tender × profile pairs, with reliable asynchronous batch processing; deployed to production after several hundred tenders were processed.</p></li><li><p>Calibrated the scoring prompt (temperature, required or preferred skills, three sub-scores) and added short justifications so users can verify each score.</p></li><li><p>Launched an annotated reference set to measure false positives and false negatives.</p></li><li><p>Built the daily report sent to about ten sales staff; secured the API and web interface with authentication and SSO. <em>Stack: Python, FastAPI, Pydantic, SQLite, Docker, GitLab CI, Gemini.</em></p></li></ul>",
      "model": "claude-haiku-5-5"
    },
